OL,3,GNEWSATwo children among four dead after
OL,4,AWaterford house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children are among four people who
OL,7,Fhave died following a house fire in
OL,8,FWaterford city in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FGardai (Irish police) confirmed the
OL,12,Fdeaths of a man and a woman and the two
OL,13,Fchildren following the blaze at a house
OL,14,Fon Birch Avenue.
OL,16,FTwo other children have been critically
OL,17,Finjured in the incident and they are
OL,18,Fbeing treated in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
