OL,3,GNEWSATwo children among four dead after
OL,4,AWaterford house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire was reported to Waterford Fire
OL,7,FService at 05:13 local time on Tuesday
OL,8,Fand it said its crews arrived to a
OL,9,Fwell-developed fire at a two-storey
OL,10,Fhouse.
